abstract: >-
  Open daily aggregates of retail fuel prices in Romania covering petrol
  (standard and premium), diesel (standard and premium) and LPG. Data
  combines official ANPC sources with direct retailer feeds and
  station-level monitoring of 1500+ locations across 8 networks. National
  daily snapshots include minimum, weighted average and maximum prices in
  RON per litre, plus station counts.
